  "description": "Boordens Street is an impactful graffiti font designed to bring bold energy and a street-style attitude to your designs. With its raw, authentic strokes and dynamic characters, this font captures the essence of urban art, making it perfect for projects that need a punch of rebellious flair.\n🎨 Urban Authenticity: The handcrafted graffiti elements give Boordens Street a unique, gritty feel that makes it ideal for posters, album covers, branding, and more.\n💥 Bold Impact: Its thick, daring strokes ensure that every word stands out, grabbing attention instantly. Whether you’re creating for digital or print, Boordens Street will give your work a commanding presence.\nBoordens Street is the go-to choice for designers looking to infuse their projects with street art’s vibrant, rebellious energy.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Boordens Street is an impactful graffiti font designed to bring bold energy and a street-style attitude to your designs. With its raw, authentic strokes and dynamic characters, this font captures the essence of urban art, making it perfect for projects that need a punch of rebellious flair.</p>\n<p>🎨 Urban Authenticity: The handcrafted graffiti elements give Boordens Street a unique, gritty feel that makes it ideal for posters, album covers, branding, and more.</p>\n<p>💥 Bold Impact: Its thick, daring strokes ensure that every word stands out, grabbing attention instantly. Whether you’re creating for digital or print, Boordens Street will give your work a commanding presence.</p>\n<p>Boordens Street is the go-to choice for designers looking to infuse their projects with street art’s vibrant, rebellious energy.</p>",
